   "subject": "Sample Effort with camera Traps",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hi Distance\r\nusers,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I have a\r\nquestion about effort calculation when it’s used with camera traps as a point\r\ntransect</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;layout-grid-mode:both\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I have\r\nto calculate the effort for a project using 21 traps for\r\n15 days in each point active for 24 h per day, i have set up the traps for 20\r\nseconds video with a delay of 2 sec. </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">The detection angle 0.733</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">RAD.</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">What is\r\nconfusing me is if I have to calculate the effort for 24 h at each point or\r\nonly the time when I shot the video of my target species<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Any\r\nsuggestion for the calculation?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Thank for any clarification</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Best</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Emiliano</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>"
    ]
   ]
