  {
   "id": "k87_42OiAAAJ",
   "from": "Eric Rexstad",
   "author": "f2122b34f1aa6e95",
   "date": "2019-02-12T08:29:42Z",
   "subject": "Re: [distance-sampling] Sample Effort with camera Traps",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Emiliano</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>I assume you are making use of the methods described in the paper </div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>Howe, Eric J., Stephen T. Buckland, Marie-Lyne Després‐Einspenner, and Hjalmar S. Kühl. 2017. Distance Sampling with Camera Traps.\r\n<em>Methods in Ecology and Evolution</em> 8 (11): 1558–65. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/2041-210X.12790\" title=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/2041-210X.12790\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://doi.org/10.1111/2041-210X.12790&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474211946000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RmjFQ2AwN9Jh4lb5cQKFR\">\r\nhttps://doi.org/10.1111/2041-210X.12790</a>.</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>The authors of that paper have provided their data in a repository described at the end of the paper: \r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>&quot;The data files from which densities of Maxwell’s duikers were estimated using Distance software, and data describing start times of videos  of Maxwell’s duikers, have been archived at the Dryad data repository (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474211946000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1VB2OkmgSwqXJMM6C8Fczj\">https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad</a>. b4c70) (Howe\r\n et al. 2017).&quot;</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>If you visit that repository link, they provide their data, as well as a description of the data, where I think you will find your answer regarding how effort was calculated:</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>&quot;Filmed Maxwell&#39;s duikers were assigned to distance intervals; recorded distances are the midpoints of the intervals. &quot;Sample.Label&quot; references the trap location. &quot;Effort&quot; is temporal effort, i.e. the number of 2-second time-steps over which the camera\r\n operated. &quot;multiplier&quot; describes spatial effort, as the proportion of a circle covered by the angle of view of the camera. The data is formatted as a &quot;flatfile&quot; suitable for use with distance sampling software including Distance and associated R packages.&quot;</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>I hope this is helpful.</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div><u></u>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/xJqs-v-u-cN9D4TzS3S2TV_D12jezCz6Uns5S-49jOekgJf7noZCQOpzJmBybxKW1xHxDRex1TP575fHlHHPb3W163BnPvYdACv6b3ey_4IZeyJP6BFSTc_t3tCau5SycAFftd3mbwUaB8mTQqy05ArI_-7vj64v7tK2drWVKg-Mg57QJ_fFrm5PnjO1jmyVrB67AZ2xsZloJao9pVvPOSKg0kz1H4kK4FgxTUJ1NAWnXXy-VhDY1EefXhsS=s0-d-e1-ft#https://user-generated.getmailspring.com/asset/MWEwZWZlOGQtMzliMy00MzQ2LWI4ZTEtNDc2ZjA4NDRiNzg5L3NpZy1sb2NhbC1kNDE2NjYxYS1iYmY5LnBuZw.png?t=1546765977623&amp;msw=250&amp;msh=248\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" style=\"max-width:60px;max-height:60px;margin-right:10px\"></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<div>Eric Rexstad</div>\r\n<div>Senior Research Fellow, CREEM, Univ. of St Andrews, Charity SC013532</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9em;border-top:1px solid gray;min-width:250px;max-width:300px;margin-top:4px;padding-top:4px\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">eric.r...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"margin-right:8px\"><a href=\"tel:+44%20(0)1334%20461833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461833</a></span></div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=The%20Observatory%2C%20Buchanan%20Gardens%2C%20St%20Andrews%20KY16%209LZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://maps.google.com/?q%3DThe%2520Observatory%252C%2520Buchanan%2520Gardens%252C%2520St%2520Andrews%2520KY16%25209LZ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474211946000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1X_4MmX_dpGnUs3AS-B6Gq\">The Observatory, Buchanan Gardens, St Andrews KY16 9LZ</a></div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://erex.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://erex.github.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474211946000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0goUB7893RLaYc-EXMr_5C\">http://erex.github.io</a></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<u></u></div></div>"
    ],
